Package: ashmortality
Title: Urban Forest Temporal Analysis Following Ash Mortality
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Mélanie", "Primeau", role = "aut"),
    person("Marie-Hélène", "Brice", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "marie-helene.brice@umontreal.ca"),
    person("Stéphanie", "Pellerin", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Reproducible workflow for analyzing temporal changes in urban
    forest composition and structure following emerald ash borer invasion
    in Montreal, Canada (2011-2023). Companion to the manuscript "Growth
    of co-occurring trees compensates for ash mortality in urban
    woodlands".
License: GPL (>= 3)
URL: https://github.com/LaboBrice/ash_mortality
BugReports: https://github.com/LaboBrice/ash_mortality/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.2)
